// From the journal, not yet reached here (spec):
//
// An object is a superposed Ray, so `Object[String]` is all of the rays in
// it that end up strings. The question is what happens to structure that
// defines steps before and after the ordinary getting and setting of a
// field — whether `.field.next` is a ray because the return has structure of
// its own — and that is the language written in itself.
